    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969150/extras/33c99f183464dbe6cc1cce477caa30a4.avif?t=1701614216\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive, not just manage</h2>Decide your racing style and see if you have what it takes to come out on top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free to play</h2>Online Racing is fun when you have loads of players to race against. That is why we are making the game Free to play and Cross Platform.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cross Progression and Cross Platform</h2>Formula Bwoah is available on Steam, iOS and Android. You can compete with users across different devices and seamlessly sync your progression across all your devices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy Matters</h2>Make strategic decisions that can impact your victory, such as choosing the perfect tire compound and changing your engine modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Weather System</h2>Timing your pit stops just right and anticipating changing weather conditions can be the difference between winning and losing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Competition</h2>Compete with 10 other skilled drivers and see if you have what it takes to emerge victorious.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969150/extras/33c99f183464dbe6cc1cce477caa30a4.avif?t=1701614216\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive, not just manage</h2>Decide your racing style and see if you have what it takes to come out on top.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free to play</h2>Online Racing is fun when you have loads of players to race against. That is why we are making the game Free to play and Cross Platform.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cross Progression and Cross Platform</h2>Formula Bwoah is available on Steam, iOS and Android. You can compete with users across different devices and seamlessly sync your progression across all your devices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategy Matters</h2>Make strategic decisions that can impact your victory, such as choosing the perfect tire compound and changing your engine modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Weather System</h2>Timing your pit stops just right and anticipating changing weather conditions can be the difference between winning and losing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Competition</h2>Compete with 10 other skilled drivers and see if you have what it takes to emerge victorious.",
    "short_description": "Formula Bwoah is a free-to-play, cross platform racing game with pit stops, engine modes and changing weather. Download now to experience a game that rewards skillful play and risk taking in online multiplayer.",
